# Feature logic

**News ticker (`js/main.js`):** Hindi RSS (BBC, DW, The Wire) via CORS proxy; CSS marquee; fallback to hardcoded civic facts if fetch fails.

**Jansunwai (`js/grievance.js`):** Local Hindi complaint draft; Web Speech API; Hinglish→Hindi via Google Input Tools; copy-ready letter. Never POST user content.

**Booth finder (`js/booth-finder.js`):** Ward 1–15 → `data/booths.json` (booths 96–101). Not the official ECI site.

**Voter search (`js/voter-search.js`):** No local roll and no personal-detail fields on this site. Redirect users directly to `https://sec.up.nic.in/site/PRIVoters.aspx` with `noopener noreferrer`; the official form handles location selections, voter name, father/husband name, and captcha.

When changing UI, keep Hindi copy, disclaimers, and 320px layout intact.